  "_comment": [
    "MultiHitBoxLib hitbox profile for orespawn:kraken (BOSS-047, hitboxes align with the rigs).",
    "Generated by danger.orespawn.tools.hitbox.BossPartProfileWriter from kraken.geo.json at the 1.7.10 render scale 1.0",
    "(orig ClientProxyOreSpawn.java:444), rest pose, body yaw 0, under the renderer's whole-model turn (the classic",
    "ModelKraken.java:733 Axis.XP.rotationDegrees(90), applied in its slot form by OreSpawnGeoReplacedEntityRenderer:",
    "the Kraken stands upright, tentacles down); boxes fitted to the drawn cubes of the bones each part",
    "covers, pivots taken back through MHLib's pivot rotation. 25 parts: the head (with mouth, teeth, eyes and jet),",
    "three body segments, the tail, two fins, and three segments per tentacle (six tentacles of eight bones: 1-2,",
    "3-5, 6-8). Damage 1.0 on every part: the 1.7.10 Kraken was one full-damage box and this landing aligns hit",
    "boxes, it does not rebalance the fight (a weak-point scheme is left open). main-hitbox keeps the 1.7.10 4x15 envelope",
    "(orig Kraken.java:73) as the swim/collision box, not pickable and taking no damage: every hit goes through a",
    "part. PlayNicely: Kraken.mhlibGetEntitySizeScale = 1/3 (render scale/3, box 1.3333334x5, orig :75)."
  ],
